{"segments": [{"start": 1.4, "end": 2.4, "text": "Boots on"}, {"start": 3.3, "end": 3.98, "text": "Nah"}, {"start": 5.24, "end": 6.34, "text": "Pause down"}, {"start": 6.34, "end": 8.3, "text": "Leash clicks tight"}, {"start": 8.3, "end": 10.22, "text": "Time to clear this town"}, {"start": 10.22, "end": 13.4, "text": "They think it's just a stroll"}, {"start": 14.0, "end": 14.62, "text": "No"}, {"start": 17.14, "end": 18.16, "text": "This is"}, {"start": 18.16, "end": 19.44, "text": "Whoa"}, {"start": 24.0, "end": 25.64, "text": "Pause, hit the concrete with precision"}, {"start": 25.64, "end": 28.26, "text": "Every sniff of mission, every shadow, suspicion"}, {"start": 28.26, "end": 30.28, "text": "Battle chain locked to my neck"}, {"start": 30.28, "end": 32.54, "text": "Like a tether blade, but I'll drag my commander"}, {"start": 32.54, "end": 33.92, "text": "Through a firefight parade"}, {"start": 33.92, "end": 36.58, "text": "Enemy sighted at two o'clock, y'all keep patrol"}, {"start": 36.58, "end": 39.24, "text": "We might pass in peace, or I might lose control"}, {"start": 39.24, "end": 41.6, "text": "I contact the contract, you bark, that's war"}, {"start": 41.6, "end": 44.24, "text": "I'll lunge so hard, I'll make my human hit the floor"}, {"start": 44.24, "end": 47.06, "text": "I love the smell of biscuits in the morning"}, {"start": 47.06, "end": 49.72, "text": "Every block's a war zone, soldier, I'm warning"}, {"start": 49.72, "end": 52.32, "text": "Pass in peace, or you're catching that growl"}, {"start": 52.32, "end": 54.92, "text": "Princess Junjun's on patrol, moving through the prowl"}, {"start": 54.92, "end": 57.54, "text": "Squirrel and surgeon, scattercats, snipers in the alley"}, {"start": 57.54, "end": 58.24, "text": "Crows passing by"}, {"start": 58.24, "end": 60.2, "text": "Call orders from the rooftop rally"}, {"start": 60.2, "end": 62.68, "text": "Hydrant checkpoints, gotta sniff and claim"}, {"start": 62.68, "end": 64.16, "text": "That's territory marked"}, {"start": 64.16, "end": 65.48, "text": "Remember the name"}, {"start": 65.48, "end": 67.94, "text": "Puff on the left, tryna puff his chest"}, {"start": 67.94, "end": 70.68, "text": "Better tuck that tail, boy respect the best"}, {"start": 70.68, "end": 73.32, "text": "My intel sharp, I'm sniffing truth from lies"}, {"start": 73.32, "end": 74.48, "text": "Read your whole history"}, {"start": 74.48, "end": 76.06, "text": "Through your fur and eyes"}, {"start": 76.06, "end": 78.54, "text": "Bark, bark, barking like a full-on riot"}, {"start": 78.54, "end": 81.16, "text": "Heavy mutt in the cut, better keep it quiet"}, {"start": 81.16, "end": 83.24, "text": "Leash tight, but I still might bite"}, {"start": 83.24, "end": 85.26, "text": "Ignite any dog, tryna front"}, {"start": 85.26, "end": 86.56, "text": "Gonna lose that fight"}, {"start": 86.56, "end": 89.24, "text": "I'm darting through yards, disregarding the guard"}, {"start": 89.24, "end": 91.94, "text": "I'm hard as a shard, from a bone that I nod"}, {"start": 91.94, "end": 94.56, "text": "Charge every yard, like a bullet from a gun"}, {"start": 94.56, "end": 97.14, "text": "Outrun any hound in the midday sun"}, {"start": 97.14, "end": 99.08, "text": "Tales of rip, jaws of clip, I unload"}, {"start": 99.08, "end": 101.16, "text": "When I grip, if you sniff too long"}, {"start": 101.16, "end": 102.44, "text": "You go sink this ship"}, {"start": 102.44, "end": 103.12, "text": "Sometimes"}, {"start": 106.84, "end": 108.72, "text": "We make it back"}, {"start": 110.48, "end": 111.48, "text": "Without fire"}, {"start": 112.76, "end": 113.6, "text": "Sometimes"}, {"start": 116.44, "end": 118.9, "text": "The street is battlefield"}, {"start": 120.24, "end": 121.9, "text": "But every mission"}, {"start": 123.24, "end": 124.92, "text": "Every walk"}, {"start": 125.48, "end": 127.12, "text": "Is a step"}, {"start": 127.12, "end": 129.86, "text": "Closer to glory"}, {"start": 133.58, "end": 136.9, "text":